    "text": "By Johnny Lopez ,\n3 hours ago At approximately 1:24 a.m. on April 20, 2026, officers responded to a multi-vehicle crash on the southbound 215 Freeway just north of University Avenue in Riverside. Investigators determined the incident began as a hit-and-run involving a pickup truck and a semi-tractor trailer, which left vehicles disabled and blocking multiple lanes of traffic. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
